t&#039;s sweet! I&#039;d love to meet you ladies. Goofy as this sounds, you&#039;re like my kids. I love to read how you met your guys, see how your plans are coming together. You all have such different personalities, it&#039;s cool to watch you all interact on this site. It makes me sad when you each get married and then don&#039;t stay! lol yep, like I said, goofy.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The 28th would work great for me since it&#039;s not labour day weekend. We&#039;re always away that weekend.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898257,"PostDate":1433860643,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> that's sweet! I'd love to meet you ladies. Goofy as this sounds, you're like my kids. I love to read how you met your guys, see how your plans are coming together. You all have such different personalities, it's cool to watch you all interact on this site. It makes me sad when you each get married and then don't stay! lol yep, like I said, goofy.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The 28th would work great for me since it's not labour day weekend. We're always away that weekend.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexi