ght.png\"><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;484\/st\/20160512\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f153\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\">","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1424038909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1441196917","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3bdc2224f3149be473522f705a18349b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Downtown is probably best since it&#039;s most central and there&#039;s transit that get&#039;s everyone there as well. I live uptown and have no issues driving down, but usually if it&#039;s a weekday like Friday I just take the bus to save myself time and parking etc.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think the majority also work downtown as well?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902694,"PostDate":1439816497,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Downtown is probably best since it's most central and there's transit that get's everyone there as well. I live uptown and have no issues driving down, but usually if it's a weekday like Friday I just take the bus t