p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Am I missing anyone?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905682,"PostDate":1443612139,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281751\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281751-deecol\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">deecol<\/span><\/a>\u00a0 lol that's a fab idea!!! oh lord Doug would have my head...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ok - just trying to see how many we are for Friday. I think 8 but just checking:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Me<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"268499\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/268499-meandhim\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Meandhim<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277519\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277519-veryvalentine\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">veryvalentine<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281751\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281751-deecol\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">deecol<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276748\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url f