dy {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>What an awesome opportunity you guys.....well done on making it happen and getting together - wow!!! It's so amazing when everyone supports each other like that - great job <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing everyone exactly what they need and are looking for to help with their plans, and all the Best to ALL!!! cheers, team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....here's some added inspirational images to boost your creativity even more.....enjoy!... from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150344652834487.362195.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Timelilne Photo Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/12095280_10153678336124487_5188646533410676333_o.jpg\" alt=\"12095280_10153678336124487_5188646533410\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11698723_10153452760859487_6040784462924892829_o.jpg\" alt=\"11698723_10153452760859487_6040784462924\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11112904_10153437585749487_5606464172347900185_o.jpg\" alt=\"11112904_10153437585749487_5606464172347\"><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n          