Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":85,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1909230,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":281615,"Name":"SunshineDreamKay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1452428095,"LastPoster":{"Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1909230,"PostDate":1452428095,"PostContent":"Hi All,\u00a0 \u00a0 FI and I are currently thinking about postponing our wedding from April until later th...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ricardoandkershia@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"82.16.59.180","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420514404,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SunshineDreamKay","Id":281615,"Name":"SunshineDreamKay","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"2.216.10.47","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79851,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9620630a462adf012a5acd79788ed314","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi All,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;FI and I are currently thinking about postponing our wedding from April until later this year. We&#039;ve looked into other months this year and for various reasons such as costs from flying from the UK, weather, work commitments, we have narrowed it down to November. We then have to consider the dates in which our travel agent fly from the UK, which is Tuesdays and Thursday and the pre wedding events we would like to have beforehand. Due to birthday celebrations earlier in the month (mine ;) ) we have narrowed down the date and think that Tuesday 22nd November could be good. This is the day after Revolution Day which is a Mexican Public holiday. Any thoughts on getting married the day after a public holiday? Will the service provided by vendors be good if they may have been out celebrating all day the day before? If there are any last minute queries, will we be able to get hold of vendors the day before? I currently have my hair and makeup planned for the day before the wedding which I think may not be possible to have the day before (not a huge issue though).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks in advance&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909230,"PostDate":1452428095,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi All,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>FI and I are currently thinking about postponing our wedding from April until later this year. We've looked into other months this year and for various reasons such as costs from flying from the UK, weather, work commitments, we have narrowed it down to November. We then have to consider the dates in which our travel agent fly from the UK, which is Tuesdays and Thursday and the pre wedding events we would like to have beforehand. Due to birthday celebrations earlier in the month (mine <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> ) we have narrowed down the date and think that Tuesday 22nd November could be good. This is the day after Revolution Day which is a Mexican Public holiday. Any thoughts on getting married the day after a public holiday? Will the service provided by vendors be good if they may have been out celebrating all day the day before? If there are any last minute queries, will we be able to get hold of vendors the day before? I currently have my hair and makeup planned for the day before the wedding which I think may not be possible to have the day before (not a huge issue though).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks in advance\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ricardoandkershia@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"82.16.59.180","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420514404,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SunshineDreamKay","Id":281615,"Name":"SunshineDreamKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"2.216.10.47","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79851,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aed2058dc9232210df1120327c1abecb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Or what even about Revolution Day itself? Could a public holiday work in Mexico?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909233,"PostDate":1452434132,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Or what even about Revolution Day itself? Could a public holiday work in Mexico?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ricardoandkershia@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"82.16.59.180","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420514404,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SunshineDreamKay","Id":281615,"Name":"SunshineDreamKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79851,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7ece8bb5840422f44678b1a79e5ad8a1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"SunshineDreamKay\"],&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As far as I know, We Wedding professional in Mexico take of what do, we are so used to doing events back to back holiday included. &amp;nbsp;I wouldn&#039;t be worried. I would make sure I work with vendors that i see their reviews and feel comfortable working with . November will have cooler weather and its still in law season.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909250,"PostDate":1452478937,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281615\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281615-sunshinedreamkay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">SunshineDreamKay<\/span><\/a>,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As far as I know, We Wedding professional in Mexico take of what do, we are so used to doing events back to back holiday included. \u00a0I wouldn't be worried. I would make sure I work with vendors that i see their reviews and feel comfortable working with . November will have cooler weather and its still in law season.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326854387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79851","Title":"Revolution Day Mexico - Get Married The Next Day?","LastPostDate":1452478937},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
